{"id":"n50978-2-14","stage":5,"title":"드리우다 · 垂下","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50978-2-14-1","ko":"하늘에 검은 구름이 점점 드리우고 있네요.","zh":"天上的乌云越来越密了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하늘에","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하늘에","audio":"/audio/8d965bcbdfa7d391c518.mp3"}},{"text":"검은","meaning":"黑","explanation":"검다：黑；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"검다","audio":"/audio/a665a697a61a0146eafb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62259","senseId":"1","lemma":"검다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검은","audio":"/audio/6fec93722a833ef0ec3e.mp3"}},{"text":"구름이","meaning":"云，云彩","explanation":"구름：云，云彩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구름","audio":"/audio/f6b5fe269180f148aa13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64487","senseId":"1","lemma":"구름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구름이","audio":"/audio/1810b9e9ed7b22ba1eaf.mp3"}},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越。","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}},{"text":"드리우고","meaning":"垂下，降临","explanation":"드리우다：垂下，降临；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"드리우다","audio":"/audio/ba8c94feb2e31b912181.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50978","senseId":"2","lemma":"드리우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드리우고","audio":"/audio/133f1c69765b117ab71e.mp3"}},{"text":"있네요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있네요","audio":"/audio/8295ec426f5c730a98e7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"a665a697a61a0146","term":"검다","zh":"黑","audio":"/audio/a665a697a61a0146eafb.mp3","entryId":"62259","definition":"颜色和没有光线的夜空一样又暗又浓。","pronunciation":["검ː따"]},{"id":"f6b5fe269180f148","term":"구름","zh":"云，云彩","audio":"/audio/f6b5fe269180f148aa13.mp3","entryId":"64487","definition":"空气中的小水滴或冰粒凝结在一起，飘浮在空中。","pronunciation":["구름"]},{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"ba8c94feb2e31b91","term":"드리우다","zh":"垂下，降临","audio":"/audio/ba8c94feb2e31b912181.mp3","entryId":"50978","definition":"光、黑暗、荫凉或影子等生出来并遮盖住；或指使成为这样。","pronunciation":["드리우다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d6cadfc277ae63e75678.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50978-2-14-2","ko":"비가 쏟아질지 모르니 안으로 들어갑시다.","zh":"说不定会下倾盆大雨，我们进屋吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"쏟아질지","meaning":"倾泻，下大","explanation":"쏟아지다：倾泻，下大；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"쏟아지다","audio":"/audio/f4ace1873bdada0ba5eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71284","senseId":"4","lemma":"쏟아지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쏟아질지","audio":"/audio/8ebe57f4f20f3233ff80.mp3"}},{"text":"모르니","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르니","audio":"/audio/56fe6fb0056d9881f6b1.mp3"}},{"text":"안으로","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안으로","audio":"/audio/f58e9a42177825301954.mp3"}},{"text":"들어갑시다.","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어갑시다","audio":"/audio/8424db67aaffa7828471.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"f4ace1873bdada0b","term":"쏟아지다","zh":"倾泻，下大","audio":"/audio/f4ace1873bdada0ba5eb.mp3","entryId":"71284","definition":"雨或雪一下子下很多，或阳光暴晒。","pronunciation":["쏘다지다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/039daf4fad21dc078a0f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.169,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=50978","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["说不定会下倾盆大雨，我们进屋吧。","看来是被敌人射出的箭击中的。","天上的乌云越来越密了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["说不定会下倾盆大雨，我们进屋吧。","天上的乌云越来越密了。","看来是被敌人射出的箭击中的。"],"answer":0}]}
